print line the xor checksum after 10000 values from (1 as a 64 bit unsigned integer)
print line the xor checksum after 10000 values from (5489 as a 64 bit unsigned integer)
print line the xor checksum after 10000 values from (9223372036854775808 as a 64 bit unsigned integer)
